[:db/ensure "e47027d5-cebb-5a6e-ba2a-199f22a1dfcf" :answer/validate] [:db/add "726fbe57-9e99-5ca8-a32c-2927b6ccd612" :answer-field/id #uuid "726fbe57-9e99-5ca8-a32c-2927b6ccd612"] [:db/add "726fbe57-9e99-5ca8-a32c-2927b6ccd612" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "726fbe57-9e99-5ca8-a32c-2927b6ccd612" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "726fbe57-9e99-5ca8-a32c-2927b6ccd612" :answer-field/choices "e47027d5-cebb-5a6e-ba2a-199f22a1dfcf"] [:db/add "726fbe57-9e99-5ca8-a32c-2927b6ccd612" :answer-field/correct "e47027d5-cebb-5a6e-ba2a-199f22a1dfcf"] [:db/ensure "726fbe57-9e99-5ca8-a32c-2927b6ccd612" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a12513cf-5b77-57ed-9d9c-cdf66ea9782e" :question/id #uuid "a12513cf-5b77-57ed-9d9c-cdf66ea9782e"] [:db/add "a12513cf-5b77-57ed-9d9c-cdf66ea9782e" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{12}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 4 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\csc{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}=2,\\quad \\csc{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "a12513cf-5b77-57ed-9d9c-cdf66ea9782e" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{12}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{12}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 4 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- 2 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\left(-2\\right)-\\left(-4\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "a12513cf-5b77-57ed-9d9c-cdf66ea9782e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a12513cf-5b77-57ed-9d9c-cdf66ea9782e" :question/answer-fields "726fbe57-9e99-5ca8-a32c-2927b6ccd612"] [:db/ensure "a12513cf-5b77-57ed-9d9c-cdf66ea9782e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "a12513cf-5b77-57ed-9d9c-cdf66ea9782e"] [:db/add "e9e6cfa2-30b7-57fc-bf92-13ef834aa870" :answer/id #uuid "e9e6cfa2-30b7-57fc-bf92-13ef834aa870"] [:db/add "e9e6cfa2-30b7-57fc-bf92-13ef834aa870" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e9e6cfa2-30b7-57fc-bf92-13ef834aa870" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "e9e6cfa2-30b7-57fc-bf92-13ef834aa870" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ec68e414-0ec0-5fdf-9da0-e316467f9a94" :answer-field/id #uuid "ec68e414-0ec0-5fdf-9da0-e316467f9a94"] [:db/add "ec68e414-0ec0-5fdf-9da0-e316467f9a94" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "ec68e414-0ec0-5fdf-9da0-e316467f9a94" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ec68e414-0ec0-5fdf-9da0-e316467f9a94" :answer-field/choices "e9e6cfa2-30b7-57fc-bf92-13ef834aa870"] [:db/add "ec68e414-0ec0-5fdf-9da0-e316467f9a94" :answer-field/correct "e9e6cfa2-30b7-57fc-bf92-13ef834aa870"] [:db/ensure "ec68e414-0ec0-5fdf-9da0-e316467f9a94" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c697346a-a2b5-5ea9-944d-83b5b405b4f7" :question/id #uuid "c697346a-a2b5-5ea9-944d-83b5b405b4f7"] [:db/add "c697346a-a2b5-5ea9-944d-83b5b405b4f7" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 3 \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cot{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\cot{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=0$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "c697346a-a2b5-5ea9-944d-83b5b405b4f7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 3 \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "c697346a-a2b5-5ea9-944d-83b5b405b4f7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c697346a-a2b5-5ea9-944d-83b5b405b4f7" :question/answer-fields "ec68e414-0ec0-5fdf-9da0-e316467f9a94"] [:db/ensure "c697346a-a2b5-5ea9-944d-83b5b405b4f7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "c697346a-a2b5-5ea9-944d-83b5b405b4f7"] [:db/add "9e4d7c72-6826-51f9-851a-030b3f004aa9" :answer/id #uuid "9e4d7c72-6826-51f9-851a-030b3f004aa9"] [:db/add "9e4d7c72-6826-51f9-851a-030b3f004aa9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9e4d7c72-6826-51f9-851a-030b3f004aa9" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "9e4d7c72-6826-51f9-851a-030b3f004aa9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a7af3103-1064-53cb-a423-c5073d533749" :answer-field/id #uuid "a7af3103-1064-53cb-a423-c5073d533749"] [:db/add "a7af3103-1064-53cb-a423-c5073d533749" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "a7af3103-1064-53cb-a423-c5073d533749" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a7af3103-1064-53cb-a423-c5073d533749" :answer-field/choices "9e4d7c72-6826-51f9-851a-030b3f004aa9"] [:db/add "a7af3103-1064-53cb-a423-c5073d533749" :answer-field/correct "9e4d7c72-6826-51f9-851a-030b3f004aa9"] [:db/ensure "a7af3103-1064-53cb-a423-c5073d533749" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "399b103b-f9fc-5fcb-9095-9fb0189a1c1d" :question/id #uuid "399b103b-f9fc-5fcb-9095-9fb0189a1c1d"] [:db/add "399b103b-f9fc-5fcb-9095-9fb0189a1c1d" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "399b103b-f9fc-5fcb-9095-9fb0189a1c1d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "399b103b-f9fc-5fcb-9095-9fb0189a1c1d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "399b103b-f9fc-5fcb-9095-9fb0189a1c1d" :question/answer-fields "a7af3103-1064-53cb-a423-c5073d533749"] [:db/ensure "399b103b-f9fc-5fcb-9095-9fb0189a1c1d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "399b103b-f9fc-5fcb-9095-9fb0189a1c1d"] [:db/add "56c65302-d79a-5cb1-aade-bbb618c33fbc" :answer/id #uuid "56c65302-d79a-5cb1-aade-bbb618c33fbc"] [:db/add "56c65302-d79a-5cb1-aade-bbb618c33fbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "56c65302-d79a-5cb1-aade-bbb618c33fbc" :answer/value "- \\csc{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "56c65302-d79a-5cb1-aade-bbb618c33fbc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "703b45b6-fdc2-56d4-b0f7-af144b3f364c" :answer-field/id #uuid "703b45b6-fdc2-56d4-b0f7-af144b3f364c"] [:db/add "703b45b6-fdc2-56d4-b0f7-af144b3f364c" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "703b45b6-fdc2-56d4-b0f7-af144b3f364c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "703b45b6-fdc2-56d4-b0f7-af144b3f364c" :answer-field/choices "56c65302-d79a-5cb1-aade-bbb618c33fbc"] [:db/add "703b45b6-fdc2-56d4-b0f7-af144b3f364c" :answer-field/correct "56c65302-d79a-5cb1-aade-bbb618c33fbc"] [:db/ensure "703b45b6-fdc2-56d4-b0f7-af144b3f364c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3c987452-833d-52ca-801c-e7c865c4a892" :question/id #uuid "3c987452-833d-52ca-801c-e7c865c4a892"] [:db/add "3c987452-833d-52ca-801c-e7c865c4a892" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "3c987452-833d-52ca-801c-e7c865c4a892" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\csc{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "3c987452-833d-52ca-801c-e7c865c4a892" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3c987452-833d-52ca-801c-e7c865c4a892" :question/answer-fields "703b45b6-fdc2-56d4-b0f7-af144b3f364c"] [:db/ensure "3c987452-833d-52ca-801c-e7c865c4a892" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "3c987452-833d-52ca-801c-e7c865c4a892"] [:db/add "a762ae91-08c8-5dc1-ab3e-8b0ec39af452" :answer/id #uuid "a762ae91-08c8-5dc1-ab3e-8b0ec39af452"] [:db/add "a762ae91-08c8-5dc1-ab3e-8b0ec39af452" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a762ae91-08c8-5dc1-ab3e-8b0ec39af452" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "a762ae91-08c8-5dc1-ab3e-8b0ec39af452" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a5559ef8-9e0d-51c7-9165-14b66785793b" :answer-field/id #uuid "a5559ef8-9e0d-51c7-9165-14b66785793b"] [:db/add "a5559ef8-9e0d-51c7-9165-14b66785793b" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "a5559ef8-9e0d-51c7-9165-14b66785793b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a5559ef8-9e0d-51c7-9165-14b66785793b" :answer-field/choices "a762ae91-08c8-5dc1-ab3e-8b0ec39af452"] [:db/add "a5559ef8-9e0d-51c7-9165-14b66785793b" :answer-field/correct "a762ae91-08c8-5dc1-ab3e-8b0ec39af452"] [:db/ensure "a5559ef8-9e0d-51c7-9165-14b66785793b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a3775cc7-4ca1-5792-8e8e-67e74410350a" :question/id #uuid "a3775cc7-4ca1-5792-8e8e-67e74410350a"] [:db/add "a3775cc7-4ca1-5792-8e8e-67e74410350a" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{0} 4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\tan{\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=-1,\\quad \\tan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "a3775cc7-4ca1-5792-8e8e-67e74410350a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{0} 4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{0} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[2 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{0}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(-2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "a3775cc7-4ca1-5792-8e8e-67e74410350a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a3775cc7-4ca1-5792-8e8e-67e74410350a" :question/answer-fields "a5559ef8-9e0d-51c7-9165-14b66785793b"] [:db/ensure "a3775cc7-4ca1-5792-8e8e-67e74410350a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "a3775cc7-4ca1-5792-8e8e-67e74410350a"] [:db/add "1ebcc078-5f5b-5153-a2be-6b7b467d35ce" :answer/id #uuid "1ebcc078-5f5b-5153-a2be-6b7b467d35ce"] [:db/add "1ebcc078-5f5b-5153-a2be-6b7b467d35ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1ebcc078-5f5b-5153-a2be-6b7b467d35ce" :answer/value "- \\frac{4 \\cot{\\left(3 x + 3 \\right)}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "1ebcc078-5f5b-5153-a2be-6b7b467d35ce" :answer/validate] [:db/add "de663327-71ff-5dc5-91bf-95991911281f" :answer-field/id #uuid "de663327-71ff-5dc5-91bf-95991911281f"] [:db/add "de663327-71ff-5dc5-91bf-95991911281f" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "de663327-71ff-5dc5-91bf-95991911281f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "de663327-71ff-5dc5-91bf-95991911281f" :answer-field/choices "1ebcc078-5f5b-5153-a2be-6b7b467d35ce"] [:db/add "de663327-71ff-5dc5-91bf-95991911281f" :answer-field/correct "1ebcc078-5f5b-5153-a2be-6b7b467d35ce"] [:db/ensure "de663327-71ff-5dc5-91bf-95991911281f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "120f2a90-dd77-5512-96e4-599cd74ab35c" :question/id #uuid "120f2a90-dd77-5512-96e4-599cd74ab35c"] [:db/add "120f2a90-dd77-5512-96e4-599cd74ab35c" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "120f2a90-dd77-5512-96e4-599cd74ab35c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{4 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{4 \\cot{\\left(3 x + 3 \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "120f2a90-dd77-5512-96e4-599cd74ab35c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "120f2a90-dd77-5512-96e4-599cd74ab35c" :question/answer-fields "de663327-71ff-5dc5-91bf-95991911281f"] [:db/ensure "120f2a90-dd77-5512-96e4-599cd74ab35c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "120f2a90-dd77-5512-96e4-599cd74ab35c"] [:db/add "d2bc3098-5bc7-5aa1-b282-dbb062bc1a03" :answer/id #uuid "d2bc3098-5bc7-5aa1-b282-dbb062bc1a03"] [:db/add "d2bc3098-5bc7-5aa1-b282-dbb062bc1a03" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d2bc3098-5bc7-5aa1-b282-dbb062bc1a03" :answer/value "\\tan{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "d2bc3098-5bc7-5aa1-b282-dbb062bc1a03" :answer/validate] [:db/add "80ad7916-a685-5554-9389-9c7d724f927f" :answer-field/id #uuid "80ad7916-a685-5554-9389-9c7d724f927f"] [:db/add "80ad7916-a685-5554-9389-9c7d724f927f" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "80ad7916-a685-5554-9389-9c7d724f927f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "80ad7916-a685-5554-9389-9c7d724f927f" :answer-field/choices "d2bc3098-5bc7-5aa1-b282-dbb062bc1a03"] [:db/add "80ad7916-a685-5554-9389-9c7d724f927f" :answer-field/correct "d2bc3098-5bc7-5aa1-b282-dbb062bc1a03"] [:db/ensure "80ad7916-a685-5554-9389-9c7d724f927f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a22f82c7-fd5e-5819-8731-d3a4255f5f8f" :question/id #uuid "a22f82c7-fd5e-5819-8731-d3a4255f5f8f"] [:db/add "a22f82c7-fd5e-5819-8731-d3a4255f5f8f" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "a22f82c7-fd5e-5819-8731-d3a4255f5f8f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\tan{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a22f82c7-fd5e-5819-8731-d3a4255f5f8f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a22f82c7-fd5e-5819-8731-d3a4255f5f8f" :question/answer-fields "80ad7916-a685-5554-9389-9c7d724f927f"] [:db/ensure "a22f82c7-fd5e-5819-8731-d3a4255f5f8f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "a22f82c7-fd5e-5819-8731-d3a4255f5f8f"] [:db/add "49c65e4e-57a9-502d-9e88-dc0de852ae0a" :answer/id #uuid "49c65e4e-57a9-502d-9e88-dc0de852ae0a"] [:db/add "49c65e4e-57a9-502d-9e88-dc0de852ae0a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "49c65e4e-57a9-502d-9e88-dc0de852ae0a" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "49c65e4e-57a9-502d-9e88-dc0de852ae0a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "172894a9-0e0a-5435-b00c-654abc55aab0" :answer-field/id #uuid "172894a9-0e0a-5435-b00c-654abc55aab0"] [:db/add "172894a9-0e0a-5435-b00c-654abc55aab0" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "172894a9-0e0a-5435-b00c-654abc55aab0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "172894a9-0e0a-5435-b00c-654abc55aab0" :answer-field/choices "49c65e4e-57a9-502d-9e88-dc0de852ae0a"] [:db/add "172894a9-0e0a-5435-b00c-654abc55aab0" :answer-field/correct "49c65e4e-57a9-502d-9e88-dc0de852ae0a"] [:db/ensure "172894a9-0e0a-5435-b00c-654abc55aab0" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "262ce555-2ea1-5af2-90b8-7a5c412925cb" :question/id #uuid "262ce555-2ea1-5af2-90b8-7a5c412925cb"] [:db/add "262ce555-2ea1-5af2-90b8-7a5c412925cb" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 4 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sec{\\left(0 \\right)}=1,\\quad \\sec{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3} \\right)}=2$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "262ce555-2ea1-5af2-90b8-7a5c412925cb" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 4 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[2 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(4\\right)-\\left(2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "262ce555-2ea1-5af2-90b8-7a5c412925cb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "262ce555-2ea1-5af2-90b8-7a5c412925cb" :question/answer-fields "172894a9-0e0a-5435-b00c-654abc55aab0"] [:db/ensure "262ce555-2ea1-5af2-90b8-7a5c412925cb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "262ce555-2ea1-5af2-90b8-7a5c412925cb"] [:db/add "dffc9365-6a7a-5e28-b7de-12da0e7f08b1" :answer/id #uuid "dffc9365-6a7a-5e28-b7de-12da0e7f08b1"] [:db/add "dffc9365-6a7a-5e28-b7de-12da0e7f08b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dffc9365-6a7a-5e28-b7de-12da0e7f08b1" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "dffc9365-6a7a-5e28-b7de-12da0e7f08b1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3a5872b9-abe8-5166-9675-198f966ed97f" :answer-field/id #uuid "3a5872b9-abe8-5166-9675-198f966ed97f"] [:db/add "3a5872b9-abe8-5166-9675-198f966ed97f" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "3a5872b9-abe8-5166-9675-198f966ed97f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3a5872b9-abe8-5166-9675-198f966ed97f" :answer-field/choices "dffc9365-6a7a-5e28-b7de-12da0e7f08b1"] [:db/add "3a5872b9-abe8-5166-9675-198f966ed97f" :answer-field/correct "dffc9365-6a7a-5e28-b7de-12da0e7f08b1"] [:db/ensure "3a5872b9-abe8-5166-9675-198f966ed97f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3b7aac27-412c-5a90-a059-92216a7c258c" :question/id #uuid "3b7aac27-412c-5a90-a059-92216a7c258c"] [:db/add "3b7aac27-412c-5a90-a059-92216a7c258c" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\tan{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\tan{\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=-1$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "3b7aac27-412c-5a90-a059-92216a7c258c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(1\\right)-\\left(-1\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "3b7aac27-412c-5a90-a059-92216a7c258c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "3b7aac27-412c-5a90-a059-92216a7c258c" :question/answer-fields "3a5872b9-abe8-5166-9675-198f966ed97f"] [:db/ensure "3b7aac27-412c-5a90-a059-92216a7c258c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "3b7aac27-412c-5a90-a059-92216a7c258c"] [:db/add "b03c3251-7439-553b-ad72-28e3cbd872f0" :answer/id #uuid "b03c3251-7439-553b-ad72-28e3cbd872f0"] [:db/add "b03c3251-7439-553b-ad72-28e3cbd872f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b03c3251-7439-553b-ad72-28e3cbd872f0" :answer/value "\\frac{\\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "b03c3251-7439-553b-ad72-28e3cbd872f0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7fc56e32-885c-5c5e-9954-2275c018a22f" :answer-field/id #uuid "7fc56e32-885c-5c5e-9954-2275c018a22f"] [:db/add "7fc56e32-885c-5c5e-9954-2275c018a22f" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "7fc56e32-885c-5c5e-9954-2275c018a22f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7fc56e32-885c-5c5e-9954-2275c018a22f" :answer-field/choices "b03c3251-7439-553b-ad72-28e3cbd872f0"] [:db/add "7fc56e32-885c-5c5e-9954-2275c018a22f" :answer-field/correct "b03c3251-7439-553b-ad72-28e3cbd872f0"] [:db/ensure "7fc56e32-885c-5c5e-9954-2275c018a22f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6" :question/id #uuid "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6"] [:db/add "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 - 4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6" :question/answer-fields "7fc56e32-885c-5c5e-9954-2275c018a22f"] [:db/ensure "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6"] [:db/add "fa1ec0d5-0a6f-5861-8adf-094ce7847be3" :answer/id #uuid "fa1ec0d5-0a6f-5861-8adf-094ce7847be3"] [:db/add "fa1ec0d5-0a6f-5861-8adf-094ce7847be3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fa1ec0d5-0a6f-5861-8adf-094ce7847be3" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "fa1ec0d5-0a6f-5861-8adf-094ce7847be3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "85edd87a-47ba-5b47-b967-0cd7189874fc" :answer-field/id #uuid "85edd87a-47ba-5b47-b967-0cd7189874fc"] [:db/add "85edd87a-47ba-5b47-b967-0cd7189874fc" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "85edd87a-47ba-5b47-b967-0cd7189874fc" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "85edd87a-47ba-5b47-b967-0cd7189874fc" :answer-field/choices "fa1ec0d5-0a6f-5861-8adf-094ce7847be3"] [:db/add "85edd87a-47ba-5b47-b967-0cd7189874fc" :answer-field/correct "fa1ec0d5-0a6f-5861-8adf-094ce7847be3"] [:db/ensure "85edd87a-47ba-5b47-b967-0cd7189874fc" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fe829f07-c75c-52fb-a210-8165808e94ed" :question/id #uuid "fe829f07-c75c-52fb-a210-8165808e94ed"] [:db/add "fe829f07-c75c-52fb-a210-8165808e94ed" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cot{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\csc{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\csc{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}=2$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "fe829f07-c75c-52fb-a210-8165808e94ed" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cot{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{\\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}=\\left(1\\right)-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "fe829f07-c75c-52fb-a210-8165808e94ed" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "fe829f07-c75c-52fb-a210-8165808e94ed" :question/answer-fields "85edd87a-47ba-5b47-b967-0cd7189874fc"] [:db/ensure "fe829f07-c75c-52fb-a210-8165808e94ed" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "fe829f07-c75c-52fb-a210-8165808e94ed"] [:db/add "ce2d1382-34fd-5922-985d-48032fb59127" :answer/id #uuid "ce2d1382-34fd-5922-985d-48032fb59127"] [:db/add "ce2d1382-34fd-5922-985d-48032fb59127" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ce2d1382-34fd-5922-985d-48032fb59127" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "ce2d1382-34fd-5922-985d-48032fb59127" :answer/validate] [:db/add "768c7847-4f5d-58f7-8535-737636a3cad4" :answer-field/id #uuid "768c7847-4f5d-58f7-8535-737636a3cad4"] [:db/add "768c7847-4f5d-58f7-8535-737636a3cad4" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "768c7847-4f5d-58f7-8535-737636a3cad4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "768c7847-4f5d-58f7-8535-737636a3cad4" :answer-field/choices "ce2d1382-34fd-5922-985d-48032fb59127"] [:db/add "768c7847-4f5d-58f7-8535-737636a3cad4" :answer-field/correct "ce2d1382-34fd-5922-985d-48032fb59127"] [:db/ensure "768c7847-4f5d-58f7-8535-737636a3cad4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b03573b5-3c33-54e5-ba16-b877200034cd" :question/id #uuid "b03573b5-3c33-54e5-ba16-b877200034cd"] [:db/add "b03573b5-3c33-54e5-ba16-b877200034cd" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cot{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=0,\\quad \\cot{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=1$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "b03573b5-3c33-54e5-ba16-b877200034cd" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[2 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(2\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "b03573b5-3c33-54e5-ba16-b877200034cd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b03573b5-3c33-54e5-ba16-b877200034cd" :question/answer-fields "768c7847-4f5d-58f7-8535-737636a3cad4"] [:db/ensure "b03573b5-3c33-54e5-ba16-b877200034cd" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "b03573b5-3c33-54e5-ba16-b877200034cd"] [:db/add "