thrm{d}u\\right)=- \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\tan{\\left(3 - 3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "cd8e3e77-0528-50e5-85fc-4e26a37d7199" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "cd8e3e77-0528-50e5-85fc-4e26a37d7199" :question/answer-fields "71ab5c94-fed8-57da-b4b1-38d582c32381"] [:db/ensure "cd8e3e77-0528-50e5-85fc-4e26a37d7199" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "cd8e3e77-0528-50e5-85fc-4e26a37d7199"] [:db/add "b52b8be3-1572-53a3-a178-6a3cfe9a9008" :answer/id #uuid "b52b8be3-1572-53a3-a178-6a3cfe9a9008"] [:db/add "b52b8be3-1572-53a3-a178-6a3cfe9a9008" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b52b8be3-1572-53a3-a178-6a3cfe9a9008" :answer/value "-1"] [:db/ensure "b52b8be3-1572-53a3-a178-6a3cfe9a9008" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8a9be053-8ff7-5a09-8987-120e07c9f6ee" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a9be053-8ff7-5a09-8987-120e07c9f6ee"] [:db/add "8a9be053-8ff7-5a09-8987-120e07c9f6ee" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "8a9be053-8ff7-5a09-8987-120e07c9f6ee" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "8a9be053-8ff7-5a09-8987-120e07c9f6ee" :answer-field/choices "b52b8be3-1572-53a3-a178-6a3cfe9a9008"] [:db/add "8a9be053-8ff7-5a09-8987-120e07c9f6ee" :answer-field/correct "b52b8be3-1572-53a3-a178-6a3cfe9a9008"] [:db/ensure "8a9be053-8ff7-5a09-8987-120e07c9f6ee" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d0a9d12a-1c6a-5869-82ed-3b368443b0d4" :question/id #uuid "d0a9d12a-1c6a-5869-82ed-3b368443b0d4"] [:db/add "d0a9d12a-1c6a-5869-82ed-3b368443b0d4" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 2 \\tan{\\left(- 2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- 2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sec{\\left(0 \\right)}=1,\\quad \\sec{\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\right)}=2$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "d0a9d12a-1c6a-5869-82ed-3b368443b0d4" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 2 \\tan{\\left(- 2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- 2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int_{0}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(-2\\right)-\\left(-1\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n-1.\n$$"] [:db/add "d0a9d12a-1c6a-5869-82ed-3b368443b0d4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "d0a9d12a-1c6a-5869-82ed-3b368443b0d4" :question/answer-fields "8a9be053-8ff7-5a09-8987-120e07c9f6ee"] [:db/ensure "d0a9d12a-1c6a-5869-82ed-3b368443b0d4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "d0a9d12a-1c6a-5869-82ed-3b368443b0d4"] [:db/add "e7f722e9-70a7-58ac-8289-58758132f251" :answer/id #uuid "e7f722e9-70a7-58ac-8289-58758132f251"] [:db/add "e7f722e9-70a7-58ac-8289-58758132f251" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e7f722e9-70a7-58ac-8289-58758132f251" :answer/value "- \\sec{\\left(3 - 3 x \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "e7f722e9-70a7-58ac-8289-58758132f251" :answer/validate] [:db/add "553902b8-0f27-5bcf-a11f-d8127f19a717" :answer-field/id #uuid "553902b8-0f27-5bcf-a11f-d8127f19a717"] [:db/add "553902b8-0f27-5bcf-a11f-d8127f19a717" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "553902b8-0f27-5bcf-a11f-d8127f19a717" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "553902b8-0f27-5bcf-a11f-d8127f19a717" :answer-field/choices "e7f722e9-70a7-58ac-8289-58758132f251"] [:db/add "553902b8-0f27-5bcf-a11f-d8127f19a717" :answer-field/correct "e7f722e9-70a7-58ac-8289-58758132f251"